---
// Sección Hero con estética cálida, limpia y profesional
---

<section class="relative bg-linear-to-b from-orange-50/40 via-white to-white py-20 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Columna de Texto -->
      <div class="space-y-6 text-center lg:text-left">
        <span class="inline-block bg-orange-100/80 text-amber-800 text-xs font-semibold px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
          Fisioterapia y Bienestar
        </span>
        
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Recupera tu movilidad y <span class="text-amber-600">vive sin dolor</span>
        </h1>
        
        <p class="text-lg text-stone-600 max-w-xl mx-auto lg:mx-0">
          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.
        </p>
        
        <!-- Botones de Acción -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-4 pt-4">
          <a 
            href="#contacto" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-amber-600/25 transition-all text-center"
          >
            Pedir Cita
          </a>
          <a 
            href="#servicios" 
            class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-stone-50 hover:bg-stone-100 text-stone-700 font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 transition-all text-center"
          >
            Ver Tratamientos
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Elemento de confianza -->
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-500 pt-2">
          ✓ Fisioterapeutas colegiados • Ambiente cálido y totalmente equipado
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna de Imagen / Contenedor con toque de madera/naranja suave -->
      <div class="relative flex justify-center">
        <div class="w-full h-80 sm:h-96 lg:h-112.5 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-amber-200/60">
          <img 
            src="/images/flowers_entrance.jpg" 
            alt="Interior de la clínica de fisioterapia" 
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>